{"id": "86302", "name": "Quadratic_1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Solve the following quadratic equation: \\[{{CT:0}} = 0\\] Hint: give your answer as a set, e.g. {5, 21+3i}. Marks are only given for a complete and correct answer. <br /> The solutions are:[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-set\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: the elements in curly brackets, separated by commas. For example <code dir=\"ltr\">{1,-2}</code>. The empty set: <code dir=\"ltr\">{}</code>.</p><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-complex\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: the imaginary unit \\(i\\) is typed as the letter <code dir=\"ltr\">i</code> (or <code dir=\"ltr\">%i</code>), and multiplication with a star. For example <code dir=\"ltr\">3-2*i</code>.</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Using the quadratic formula \\[z=\\frac{-b±\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}\\] for the solutions of the equation \\(az^2+bz+c=0\\) to solve {{CT:1}} gives \\[z= \\frac{{{CT:2}}±\\sqrt{{{CT:3}}^2-4*{{CT:4}}*{{CT:5}}}}{{CT:6}}=\\frac{{{CT:2}}±{{CT:7}}}{{CT:6}}={{CT:8}}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "sol", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wrongsol", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<p>Have you forgotten the square root of -1 is i?</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["acoeff", "bcoeff", "ccoeff", "n1", "n2", "pol", "sol", "wrongsol"], "nvariants": 50}